# 🚀 AI-PMO Automation Tools
A collection of AI agents built in Google AI Studio to automate PMO governance and project delivery.

### 📈 Business Value
* **Efficiency:** Automates repetitive governance tasks like RAID log updates and MOM drafting.
* **Speed:** Leverages Google AI Studio to process project data faster than manual entry.
* **Consistency:** Ensures standardized reporting formats across cross-functional teams.

### 🛠️ Core Features
* **PMO Agent:** A Python-based agent (`pmo_agent.py`) designed to handle project queries and status tracking.
* **Governance Automation:** Built-in logic to assist with Agile ceremonies and sprint health checks.
